[{"id":74593,"sender_id":11,"sender_full_name":"Urs","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b00d1ee17463af676c78974439b92471?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/1-nLab/topic/nLab.20edit.20job.20offer/near/74593\">#1</a> <a href=\"https://tonpa.guru/\">Maksym Sokhatskyi</a> announces that he is offering payment of </p>\n<p><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">$</mi><mn>400</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n  \\$400/\\mathrm{month}\n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">$400/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">month</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>to anyone doing the job of adding to the <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span>Lab, upon request, exposition and explanation of various basic mathematical topics, as needed by a community of type theorists looking into formalization of mathematics. </p>\n<p>Concretely, there is demand for adding exposition/explanation to relevant <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span>Lab pages of more basics of differential geometry formulated in terms of differential forms and de Rham calculus, than can currently be found on the <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span>Lab.</p>\n<p>See his </p>\n<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mphantom><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phantom{\\mathrm{AAAA}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:transparent;\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"color:transparent;\">AAAA</span></span></span></span></span><strong><a href=\"http://groupoid.space/ncatlab/index.html\">Sponsorship call for submissions</a></strong></p>\n<p>and be sure to email him at <code>maxim@synrc.com</code> for details of the arrangement.</p>\n<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mphantom><mi>A</mi></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phantom{A}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"color:transparent;\">A</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>(This has grown out of a discussion where somebody else had complained about some <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span>Lab page not providing useful examples, and me suggesting that you can’t complain about the the scope of work that is made available by volunteers unless and until you are paying for it.)</p>","timestamp":1548850031,"subject":"nLab edit job offer","stream_id":1,"display_recipient":"nLab","reactions":[]},{"id":74596,"sender_id":237,"sender_full_name":"Richard Williamson","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b90dbe6063b47a44f7308efebb6ade2b?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/1-nLab/topic/nLab.20edit.20job.20offer/near/74596\">#2</a> Exciting! I hope they find somebody.</p>","timestamp":1548862175,"subject":"nLab edit job offer","stream_id":1,"display_recipient":"nLab","reactions":[]},{"id":74597,"sender_id":11,"sender_full_name":"Urs","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b00d1ee17463af676c78974439b92471?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/1-nLab/topic/nLab.20edit.20job.20offer/near/74597\">#3</a> He says he already received several offers…</p>","timestamp":1548862291,"subject":"nLab edit job offer","stream_id":1,"display_recipient":"nLab","reactions":[]},{"id":74865,"sender_id":11,"sender_full_name":"Urs","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b00d1ee17463af676c78974439b92471?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/1-nLab/topic/nLab.20edit.20job.20offer/near/74865\">#4</a> All right, a deal and payment for a first month has been made now. I suppose this means we’ll be seeing a new contributor now making regular edits. But I don’t know what exactly will happen now :-)</p>","timestamp":1549886627,"subject":"nLab edit job offer","stream_id":1,"display_recipient":"nLab","reactions":[]},{"id":74866,"sender_id":237,"sender_full_name":"Richard Williamson","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b90dbe6063b47a44f7308efebb6ade2b?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/1-nLab/topic/nLab.20edit.20job.20offer/near/74866\">#5</a> Exciting!</p>","timestamp":1549886668,"subject":"nLab edit job offer","stream_id":1,"display_recipient":"nLab","reactions":[]},{"id":75351,"sender_id":11,"sender_full_name":"Urs","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b00d1ee17463af676c78974439b92471?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/1-nLab/topic/nLab.20edit.20job.20offer/near/75351\">#6</a> It seems that production is starting now with <em><a href=\"https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/HR%20manifold\">HR manifold</a></em> (a topic in <a href=\"https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/Cartan%20geometry\">Cartan geometry</a>, connecting to our existing stub <em><a href=\"https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/CR%20manifold\">CR manifold</a></em> and with a further entry <em><a href=\"https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/BR%20manifold\">BR manifold</a></em> apparently in preparation), see also the thread <a href=\"#narrow/channel/2/topic/HR.20manifold/near/75348\">there</a>.</p>\n<p>I am in the process of contacting the author regarding interaction here on the <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span>Forum.</p>","timestamp":1552480719,"subject":"nLab edit job offer","stream_id":1,"display_recipient":"nLab","reactions":[]}]